    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d633">

                <pb facs="1090" n="1030" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg1030"/>

                <head>Mr. Sullivan to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 20.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Bogota,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-08-27"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >August</hi> 27, 1867.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inclose copies (A and
                    B) of correspondence just had between myself and Rear-Admiral James S. Palmer,
                    United States navy, commanding the North Atlantic squadron, on the subject of
                    affairs in this country, &amp;c., &amp;c.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, very respectfully, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>PETER J. SULLIVAN.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D. C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>



                <xi:include href="d633-a1.xml" xpointer="d633-a1"/>
